  designNotes: 'Fall Guy: when an enemy effect would make another friendly creature
    Revealed or destroy it (Perfectly Timed Camera Malfunction, Extreme Prejudice...),
    it lands on the Lone Gunman instead: the official story needs one man who did
    it all. (Was Scapegoat, too close to Mind''s Escape Goat.)'
  artDescription: A bewildered young man in a cheap suit shoved in front of flashing
    press cameras, holding a rifle he has clearly never seen before, a LONE GUNMAN
    placard hung round his neck, while two men in dark suits and hats slip away behind
    a picket fence on a grassy knoll.
